      "side": 1,
      "message": "The IT8XX2 TCPC isn\u0027t under an i2c bus. You can check that by looking at the entry in the `tcpc_config` array:\n```\n#define TCPC_CONFIG_IT8XXX2(id)                   \\\n\t{                                         \\\n\t\t.bus_type \u003d EC_BUS_TYPE_EMBEDDED, \\\n\t\t.drv \u003d \u0026it8xxx2_tcpm_drv,         \\\n\t\t.flags \u003d 0,                       \\\n\t},\n```\n`bus_type` is `EC_BUS_TYPE_EMBEDDED`, but other TCPCs have `EC_BUS_TYPE_I2C`.",
